  "system": {
    "summary": {
      "value": ""
    },
    "description": "<p>The strength of the earth itself surges through your ally. Until this spell ends, the target treats their <strong>Might</strong> and <strong>Willpower</strong> attributes as one die size higher (up to a maximum of d12) and is immune to <strong>weak</strong> and <strong>shaken</strong> as long as they are standing on solid ground. They lose the benefit in mid-air, on a platform, or on the deck of a ship, but regain it if they reach the ground again during this scene.</p><p><em>Note: in practical terms, this means there are encounters you just won’t be able to use it in.</em></p><hr /><p><strong>@LOSS[20 mp]</strong> </p>",
